{"v":4,"catch":"加速並跳躍！ 通過所有對手並瞄準目的地！！","desc":"“BURNIN'RUBBER”是Data East在1982年發布的動作遊戲。\n與敵方車輛比賽，避開障礙物並瞄準前方目標。\n加速將使跳躍成為可能，使您不僅可以避開障礙物，而且可以降落在敵方車輛上，使它們爆炸以獲取積分。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-09-24","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/72ad9367ebeba8bbbcc10a5ff0891efa02cf7e9a0300c95b924a05a2aa620b61.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a5a9feaaf5223a3b57a27f6beefc9c76cfd72dc2727332bf353e247b32c427e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dd422bb8deb5aa1c6f5ba2986d4ec0f4b57004b290455cbaa64b04b3888f2991.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7dc505b3a3bdf96a5df6b77f333cecc815c3065da26cb4f6f7128f8c04944859.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1a9fd10e837f1a8fb7bd32380b501a84980287d47456274645f3e0608f94609b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cd508bbd5ef657f9f3cee5776e2858e4a6592e16f11c91ece7fc811cf29d14da.jpg"],"titleId":"01003b4012478000","dlc":[]}